          "content": {
            "id": "72155a15-9080-3e7f-99df-e7ddedf05f69",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "BioLargo initiates alpha testing of Verralize\u2019s portable PFAS test kit",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "BioLargo (BLGO) has commenced \u201calpha testing\u201d of a PFAS-detecting portable water test kit developed by Verralize. Verralize\u2019s \u201clab-on-a-sensor\u201d test kit enables rapid, on-site detection of per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances, the so-called \u201cforever chemicals\u201d regulated under the U.S. Safe Drinking Water Act. The kit is user-friendly, low-cost, and distinguishes between different PFAS molecules, making it a powerful tool for water treatment operators to ensure system performance and public safety",
